# SuperDemocracy vision

Before changing product behavior, architecture, or copy, read `docs/plan/README.md`, `docs/plan/constitution.md`, `docs/plan/north-star.md`, and `docs/plan/governance-principles.md`. The full reference is `docs/plan/master-plan.md`.

Current code defines what exists; it does not outrank the vision documents (authority order in `docs/plan/README.md`). The North Star and Master Plan are the starting plan and can become outdated. A later `docs/DECISION-LOG.md` entry wins over them (D-2026-10-29-01). If a proposed decision conflicts with either, warn the Chief Architect before recording it. If they go ahead, the entry holds the discussion summary and the reasons. When code and docs disagree, add an entry to `docs/DECISION-LOG.md` instead of silently picking a side. Open questions are indexed from `docs/plan/todo.md`, which points at the project whiteboard. Do not invent scope, and do not remove built features to match a narrower document.

Member-facing UI: follow `docs/product-language-guide.md` (no blockchain jargon in community-org flows).
